Package: bfbin2arm
Type: Package
Title: Bayes Factor Design for Two-Arm Binomial Trials
Version: 0.1.8
Date: 2026-10-27
Authors@R: 
    c(person(given = "Riko", family = "Kelter", role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "rkelter@uni-koeln.de"))
Description: Design and analysis of one- and two-stage clinical
    trials using Bayes factors. Implements methods for binomial endpoints
    described by Kelter and Pawel (2025)
    <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2502.02914> and Kelter and Pawel (2025)
    <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2511.23144>.
    Also supports continuous endpoints, point-null and directional
    hypotheses, power calculations, and sample size calibration.
    Supports single-arm trials and two-arm trials with treatment
    and control groups. Includes methods for equivalence,
    non-inferiority, and superiority designs.
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.0.0)
